<task id="060" project="spaarkeai-compose-r6">
  <metadata>
    <title>Round-trip fidelity harness — round-trip the corpus; fail on hard-fail/regression</title>
    <phase>6 Round-trip fidelity harness (CI release gate)</phase>
    <gate>dep:027,004</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>TEST-MODIFYING (adds `tests/**` harness, tags include testing) → FULL gate UNCONDITIONALLY per CLAUDE.md §8 override row; also builds the release-gating fidelity harness (high blast radius on the CI signal). code-review + adr-check at Step 9.5.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>plan.md §5 Phase 6 assigns sonnet: the round-trip harness reuses the existing corpus + `DocumentFormat.OpenXml` byte-diff machinery and the render-on-save path; well-specified, no novel algorithm.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Exercises the shared render-on-save path (`Services/Compose/**`) and the contended `tests/fixtures/compose-corpus/**` + `tests/integration/**` trees shared across Compose worktrees; must serialize behind Phase 1–2 landing.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>027, 004</deps>
    <tags>testing, ci</tags>
